{{Quotation|game|Earned from PvP League Division Chests.}}

[[Has game icon::File:Ascended Shard of Glory.png|24px]] [[Ascended Shard of Glory|Ascended Shards of Glory]] are a currency obtained from completing [[PvP league]] [[PvP_League#Rewards|reward tracks]]. They can be used together with [[Shard of Glory|Shards of Glory]] to purchase [[ascended equipment]] from the [[Ascended Armor League Vendor]] and [[Ascended Weapon League Vendor]]; a complete set of one ascended armor costs 800 Ascended Shards of Glory, 20 Grandmaster Marks, and 13 gold.

== Acquisition ==
=== [[PvP League reward track]] ===
Completing the last tier of each [[PvP League#Rewards|seasonal reward chest]] in the [[PvP league]] will award from 25 to 100 Ascended Shards of Glory. Repeated completions of the final reward tier will award additional Ascended Shards of Glory. The breakdown of rewards for each tier is as follows:
